        <div className="dashboard-grid"><section className="panel recent-panel"><SectionTitle title={role === 'admin' ? 'HOD requests to review' : role === 'hod' ? 'Department requests to review' : 'Recent event requests'} subtitle={role === 'admin' || role === 'hod' ? 'Keep approvals moving forward' : 'Track your latest submissions'} action={link('View all', role === 'admin' || role === 'hod' ? 'approvals' : 'requests')}/>{eventTable((role === 'admin' || role === 'hod' ? incoming : myRequests).slice(0, 4), role !== 'admin' && role !== 'hod')}</section><section className="panel workflow-panel"><div className="panel-eyebrow"><span className="workflow-symbol"><Icon name="sparkles" size={17}/></span> HOW IT WORKS</div><h2>One venue.<br/>Everything in place.</h2><p>Choose a space and its included equipment comes with it. Add extras only when needed.</p><div className="workflow-steps">{['Event details', 'Venue + included resources', 'Optional extras', role === 'admin' ? 'Admin approves HOD' : role === 'hod' ? 'HOD / Admin decision' : 'HOD gives final approval'].map((step, i) => <div className="workflow-row" key={step}><span className={`workflow-number ${i === 0 ? 'first' : ''}`}>{i + 1}</span><span>{step}</span></div>)}</div><div className="workflow-foot"><Icon name="info" size={16}/><span>Admin reviews HOD-created events only.</span></div></section></div>
